:: Start
You are in a small room. A mirror hangs on the wall.
<<set $seen to true>>
<<set $coins to 7>>
[[Open the door->Hall]]
[[Look in the mirror->Mirror]]

:: Hall
The hall is long. You walk carefully.
[[Continue->End]]
[[Back->Start]]

:: Mirror
Your reflection blinks first.
<<set $coins to $coins + 5>>
[[Leave->Start]]

:: End
You made it out. The end.
